### **DAX Grain Protection &amp; Virtual Mapping**

#### **Option A: Grain Protection with** **ISINSCOPE()**

Prevents displaying misleading category targets when a user drills down to an individual SKU:

```
Safe Target Amount = 
IF(
    ISINSCOPE(DimProduct[ProductID]),
    BLANK(), -- Protects grain at Product level
    SUM(FactTargets[TargetAmount])
)

```

#### **Option B: Virtual Relationship with** **TREATAS()**

If physical relationships are not established, map the filter context virtually in DAX:

```
Virtual Target Amount = 
CALCULATE(
    SUM(FactTargets[TargetAmount]),
    TREATAS(VALUES(DimDate[MonthYear]), FactTargets[MonthYear]),
    TREATAS(VALUES(DimCategory[Category]), FactTargets[Category])
)
```
